# Everything here is dev-only and must never be served as a public asset, even
# though wrangler.jsonc's assets.directory is "." (the whole folder). Verified
# with `WRANGLER_LOG=debug wrangler deploy --dry-run` -- see
# in-progress/CLOUDFLARE_SYNC.md.
#
# Folder layout matches the sibling vocabula project (2026-08-23):
#   evergreen/    documents that stay live and get edited
#   in-progress/  research memos still in flight
#   archive/      retired code and finished documents
#   upload-bundle/  generated; the exact contents of the deploy repo. It MUST
#                 be ignored here or the whole app would be served a second
#                 time under /upload-bundle/.
evergreen/
in-progress/
archive/
upload-bundle/
*.md
BUILD
.claude/
tests/
# Test-only data: the two appendix inventories and the cells archived out of
# the deck. None is loaded by any HTML page; shipping them would add a quarter
# of a megabyte to every install for nothing.
data/appendix.js
data/latin-appendix.js
data/greek-archive.js
sync-worker/
tools/
.assetsignore
wrangler.jsonc
.git/
.wrangler/
.DS_Store
